<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title> Cruz Spells | Business Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #172a46;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 42px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #172a46;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .skill {
            background-color: #e8eef5;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .project {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .project h3 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #172a46;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background-color: #172a46;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Your Name</h1>
    <p>Business Management Student | Future Business Professional</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>Personal Statement</h2>

    <p>
        I am a Business Management student at Rutgers University developing
        skills in leadership, finance, communication, and business operations
        while preparing for a career in the business world.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Skills</h2>

    <div class="skills">
        <div class="skill">Leadership</div>
        <div class="skill">Communication</div>
        <div class="skill">Financial Management</div>
        <div class="skill">Teamwork</div>
        <div class="skill">Problem Solving</div>
        <div class="skill">Microsoft Excel</div>
        <div class="skill">Business Operations</div>
        <div class="skill">Time Management</div>
        <div class="skill">Organization</div>
        <div class="skill">Project Management</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Projects</h2>

    <div class="project">
        <h3>Logistics Research Project</h3>
        <p>
            A research project examining the logistics profession,
            including the responsibilities, skills, and career opportunities
            involved in managing the movement of goods and resources.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <h3>Leadership Improvement Plan</h3>
        <p>
            A leadership project focused on identifying areas for personal
            improvement and creating goals and strategies for developing
            stronger leadership skills.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <h3>Business Case Analysis</h3>
        <p>
            An academic project analyzing a business situation and applying
            management and leadership concepts to understand challenges and
            possible solutions.
        </p>
    </div>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Your Name | Rutgers University</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
